WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.618
"I haven’t lost my mind," said Aladdin to his mother.

2
00:00:04.619 --> 00:00:07.988
"I have lost my heart to Princess Badra."

3
00:00:07.989 --> 00:00:11.821
"What about the sultan?" Zeba asked.

4
00:00:11.822 --> 00:00:14.711
"Why would he give his daughter to you?

5
00:00:14.712 --> 00:00:18.143
Who would dare ask him?"

6
00:00:18.144 --> 00:00:20.985
"You," answered Aladdin.

7
00:00:20.986 --> 00:00:23.809
" You will ask the

8
00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:26.479
sultan." "What?" Zeba

9
00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:30.703
shouted. "Me? Do you think I have lost my mind

10
00:00:30.704 --> 00:00:35.285
too?" "If you refuse, I will die," said

11
00:00:35.286 --> 00:00:41.803
Aladdin. "And if I ask the sultan such a silly thing, we will both die!" cried

12
00:00:41.804 --> 00:00:45.265
Zeba. "He will kill us for being too

13
00:00:45.266 --> 00:00:48.626
bold." Aladdin thought a moment and then

14
00:00:48.627 --> 00:00:51.042
spoke. "The sultan is a good

15
00:00:51.043 --> 00:00:54.557
man. The people always come to him for help and

16
00:00:54.558 --> 00:00:57.285
favors. This is well-known,

17
00:00:57.286 --> 00:01:00.589
Mother." "You speak truly," she

18
00:01:00.590 --> 00:01:06.635
agreed. "But the sultan expects a gift, a very nice gift, for his time and

19
00:01:06.636 --> 00:01:11.012
wisdom. We have nothing fancy to present to the

20
00:01:11.013 --> 00:01:13.776
sultan." "You are right," said

21
00:01:13.777 --> 00:01:16.711
Aladdin. "We need a gift that he will

22
00:01:16.712 --> 00:01:20.025
notice." His face lit up with a big

23
00:01:20.026 --> 00:01:25.977
smile. "Mother," he said, "have you forgotten the jewels I took from the enchanted

24
00:01:25.978 --> 00:01:29.714
treasury? Quick, bring our best serving

25
00:01:29.715 --> 00:01:35.697
bowl." As Zeba ran into the kitchen, Aladdin walked over to a large pot on a

26
00:01:35.698 --> 00:01:39.760
shelf. He took out a leather bag filled with

27
00:01:39.761 --> 00:01:44.788
jewels. "Here you are, son," Zeba said, as she held out the

28
00:01:44.789 --> 00:01:48.182
bowl. Aladdin poured the jewels into the

29
00:01:48.183 --> 00:01:54.686
bowl. The beautiful stones sparkled so brightly that Zeba could not look at

30
00:01:54.687 --> 00:01:58.974
them. "These are the biggest jewels in the world," said

31
00:01:58.975 --> 00:02:01.617
Aladdin. "You must take them to the

32
00:02:01.618 --> 00:02:05.272
sultan. Tell him your son wishes to marry his daughter."

33
00:02:05.273 --> 00:02:10.384
"I will do what you want, my son," said Zeba.

34
00:02:10.385 --> 00:02:15.775
She arrived at a large hall where many people had gathered to see the sultan.

35
00:02:15.776 --> 00:02:17.334
Zeba was nervous.

36
00:02:17.335 --> 00:02:20.904
The people waiting all looked very rich.

37
00:02:20.905 --> 00:02:25.695
"They must be so important!" she thought.

38
00:02:25.696 --> 00:02:32.431
Watching over everything was the sultan’s most trusted adviser—the grand vizier.

39
00:02:32.432 --> 00:02:37.770
He saw Zeba come into the hall and take a seat in a corner by the wall.

40
00:02:37.771 --> 00:02:42.431
"Who is this woman and what is she carrying?" he wondered.

41
00:02:42.432 --> 00:02:47.821
"What business does she have with the sultan?"

42
00:02:47.822 --> 00:02:52.491
Trumpets blew as the sultan entered and sat on his throne.

43
00:02:52.492 --> 00:02:59.163
As each person stepped before the sultan and asked for a favor, Zeba watched and listened.

44
00:02:59.164 --> 00:03:02.981
But she was too afraid to speak to the sultan that day.

45
00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:07.291
When the meeting was over, she returned home.

46
00:03:07.292 --> 00:03:12.199
Every day, Zeba went to the hall and sat in the same spot.

47
00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:18.090
Many days passed, but still she did not dare speak to the sultan about her son.

48
00:03:18.091 --> 00:03:22.041
Each night, she returned home with the jewels.

49
00:03:22.042 --> 00:03:26.629
One day, the sultan leaned close to the grand vizier.

50
00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:31.143
"Who is that woman who comes each day?" he whispered.

51
00:03:31.144 --> 00:03:33.632
"And what does she want?"

52
00:03:33.633 --> 00:03:38.942
"She’s nobody important," replied the grand vizier with a frown.

53
00:03:38.943 --> 00:03:43.946
"She probably wants to complain about her neighbors."

54
00:03:43.947 --> 00:03:47.930
The sultan was not satisfied with this answer.

55
00:03:47.931 --> 00:03:51.327
"Tomorrow, bring her before me."

56
00:03:51.328 --> 00:03:55.421
The next day, Zeba sat in her usual corner.

57
00:03:55.422 --> 00:04:01.068
As she sat watching and waiting, she saw the grand vizier point to her.

58
00:04:01.069 --> 00:04:09.446
"Stand," he commanded, "and be presented to the sultan!"

